      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1915-01-02_WidnesExaminer_art0207" n="art0207">
        <head>SALES BY AUCTION</head>
        <p>SALES BY AUCTION</p>
        <p>HERBERT JOHNSON,</p>
        <p>AUCTIONEER AND VALUER. BEWSEY CHAMBERS, WARRINGTON. Sales by Auction of Freehold and Leasehold Properties, Building Land, Ground Rents. Farming and Trade Stocks, Household Furni- ture, Stocks, Shares, and Debentures. Valuations for Sale, Probate and Mortgage, on reasonable terms. Sale room, Queen-street. Invited.</p>
        <p>Consignments</p>
        <p>HENRY TAYLOR. AUCTIONEER AND VALUER. ESTATE &amp; INSURANCE AGENT,</p>
        <p>15, BOLD-STREET. WARRINGTON.</p>
