      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1915-01-02_WidnesExaminer_art0235" n="art0235">
        <head>ARE ANY NAMES OMITTED?</head>
        <p>ARE ANY NAMES OMITTED?</p>
        <p>"Although every endeavour has been made to make the list of Old Boys serving with His Majesty's forces as complete as possible," writes Mr. E. S. A. Robson, the Headmaster, "I shall be glad to receive particulars of rank and regiment from those whose names may have been omitted."</p>
